Package: gamlss.longitudinal
Type: Package
Title: Fit Longitudinal Data Using GAMLSS Margins and Copula Dependence Structures
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Aydin Sareff-Hibbert
Maintainer: Aydin Sareff-Hibbert <aydin.hibbert@sydney.edu.au>
Description: Fits longitudinal generalized additive models for location, scale
    and shape (GAMLSS) with flexible copula dependence structures across time.
    Provides adoption-focused helpers for marginal-family screening,
    longitudinal fitting, inference, prediction, simulation, diagnostics, and
    opt-in benchmarks against common GEE, GLMM, and GAM baselines.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
